					<h2 class="section-heading a-up">Petit Trois</h2>
															<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3">
						<p>ABOUT PETIT TROIS</p>
<p>Petit Trois at MOLLIE Aspen is a full-service restaurant and the vibrant culinary heart of the hotel. Brought to life by celebrated Chef Ludo Lefebvre, this marks the acclaimed French bistro’s very first location outside of Los Angeles. By blending timeless Parisian charm with Aspen’s soulful mountain energy, we invite guests and locals alike to gather over classic French cuisine in an unforgettable alpine setting.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="section-buttons a-up a-delay-4">
						



			<div 		>
				<a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.opentable.com/r/petit-trois-aspen" target="_self">
			Make a Reservation					</a>
			</div>
							<div>
							<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/restaurants-bars/petit-trois/" class="link">
								View More							</a>
						</div>
						



					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
