											Dinner Menu										</a>
																	</div>
						</div>
										<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3">
						<p>Petit Trois Aspen is an award-winning Parisian-inspired bistro from Chef Ludo Lefebvre. Hailing from Burgundy, Chef Ludo brings his signature flair to classic French dishes, turning simple classics into something extra special.</p>
<p>The full-service dining space serves daily breakfast, lunch, and dinner. The bar is an inviting destination, with elegant and complex cocktails, a curated wine list, and a thoughtful selection of beers and ciders.</p>
					</div>
