											Breakfast Menu										</a>
																				<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/MOLLIE_MENU_CAFE_PM_7.29.26-web.pdf" class="hp-taste__link" target="_blank">
											Lunch Menu										</a>
																	</div>
						</div>
										<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3">
						<p>Nestled within MOLLIE, the Cafe offers Sightglass coffee, perfectly blended matcha lattes, and a variety of Rishi Select Teas. It also features a selection of prepared breakfast and pastry options, and a special lunch menu from Petit Trois. </p>
<p>In the afternoon it transitions to a Wine Bar with a snack menu by Chef Ludo and an exciting wine list, including a significant number of wines by the glass.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="section-buttons a-up a-delay-4">
						



						<div>
							<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/dine-drink/cafe/" class="link">
								View More							</a>
						</div>
						



					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
				<section class="hp-taste dinings-single full-content-image" id="petit-familia">
			<div class="container dining-full-content-image__inner">
								<div class="hp-taste__media">
					<div class="hp-taste__slide bg-cover is-active">
						<img width="2048" height="1366" src="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Petit Familia agave cocktail at MOLLIE Aspen" decoding="async" srcset="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920.jpg 2048w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920-300x200.jpg 300w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920-768x512.jpg 768w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920-1536x1025.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px" />					</div>
					<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Petit_Familia_Aspen_26920.jpg" class="hp-taste__fancybox" data-fancybox="gallery">
						<img src="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/themes/mollie/assets/img/icon-plus.svg" alt="Open Lightbox" loading="lazy">
					</a>
				</div>
								<div class="hp-taste__content full-content-image__content">
					<h2 class="section-heading a-up">Petit Familia</h2>
											<div class="hp-taste__hours a-up a-delay-1">
																 <p>OPEN WED-SUN: 4:00PM-10:00PM</p>
																		 <p>CLOSED 10/10 & 10/16 FOR PRIVATE EVENTS</p>
															</div>
															<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3">
						<p>ABOUT PETIT FAMILIA</p>
<p>Located on the third floor, Petit Familia is an intimate indoor/outdoor lounge with unparalleled views of Aspen Mountain. The menu celebrates the versatility of tequila and mezcal in signature cocktails, and also includes thoughtfully-crafted NA drinks and a well-curated beer and wine list. Chef Ludo Lefebvre’s delicious bar snacks combine the precision of Petit Trois with the playfulness of Trois Familia to create a new, only-in-Aspen experience.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="section-buttons a-up a-delay-4">
						



						<div>
							<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/restaurants-bars/petit-familia/" class="link">
								View More							</a>
						</div>
						



					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
				<section class="hp-taste dinings-single full-content-image" id="roof-terrace-bar">
			<div class="container dining-full-content-image__inner">
								<div class="hp-taste__media">
					<div class="hp-taste__slide bg-cover is-active">
						<img width="2000" height="1333" src="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="The Roof Terrace Bar at MOLLIE" decoding="async" srcset="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web.jpg 2000w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web-300x200.jpg 300w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web-768x512.jpg 768w, https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px" />					</div>
					<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Mollie_20250922-0209-HDR-web.jpg" class="hp-taste__fancybox" data-fancybox="gallery">
						<img src="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/themes/mollie/assets/img/icon-plus.svg" alt="Open Lightbox" loading="lazy">
					</a>
				</div>
								<div class="hp-taste__content full-content-image__content">
					<h2 class="section-heading a-up">Roof Terrace Bar</h2>
											<div class="hp-taste__hours a-up a-delay-1">
																 <p>OPEN WED-SUN: 4:00PM-10:00PM</p>
																		 <p>CLOSED 10/10, & 10/16 FOR PRIVATE EVENTS</p>
															</div>
																<div class="hp-taste__menus a-up a-delay-2">
							<p class="text-lg">Menus</p>
							<div class="hp-taste__links">
																		<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MOLLIE_MENU_PF_6.19.26.pdf" class="hp-taste__link" target="_blank">
											Petit Familia Menu										</a>
																	</div>
						</div>
										<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3">
						<p>The Roof Terrace Bar, Petit Familia, is an intimate 3rd floor lounge offering unparalleled views of Aspen Mountain. The bar celebrates the rich versatility of agave spirits with signature tequila and mezcal cocktails, and an innovative French-Mexican menu of bar snacks from Chef Ludo Lefebvre.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="section-buttons a-up a-delay-4">
						



			<div 		>
				<a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://mollieaspen.com/events/" target="_blank">
			View Upcoming Events					</a>
			</div>
							<div>
							<a href="https://mollieaspen.com/restaurants-bars/roof-terrace-bar/" class="link">
								View More							</a>
						</div>
						



					</div>
